godotengine/godot/pull/110748.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110748.patch","merged_at":"2025-11-07T16:37:19Z"},"body":"Introduces new functions `get_changed_settings` and `check_changed_settings_in_group`. This brings Project Settings to parity with the Editor Settings functionality.\r\n\r\nThis allows much more fine-grained responses to setting changes.\r\n\r\nThis approach is non-breaking.\r\n\r\n``` gdscript\r\nfunc _enter_tree() -> void:\r\n\tProjectSettings.settings_changed.connect(_on_project_settings_changed)\r\n\t\r\nfunc _on_project_settings_changed() -> void:\r\n\tprint(\"_on_project_settings_changed\")\r\n\t\r\n\tif !ProjectSettings.check_changed_settings_in_group('my_settings'):\r\n\t\treturn\r\n\r\n\tvar changed_settings = ProjectSettings.get_changed_settings()\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nAs part of this, the `settings_changed` is now only emitted when a settings value is set to a different value.\r\n\r\nFixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110747\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13244\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","s